      },
      "cr": 0.125,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Liberated Toads cohort sheet — Elemen T.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-liberated-toads-actors.py</code> from the Pond Patrol docket (<code>data/liberatedToadsSystem.json</code>, snapshot Highsun 24, 1040 BF): level 2 on the docket → CR 1/8 on the Commoner line (ordinary toads without specialized training, but with potential) — the docket defines no healer class, so the cohort feat carries the trade; a ward smock (AC 11), hit points 2d6 + 2. A GM-ready reading of the docket, not a filed stat line; the docket stays the authority.</p><p><strong>The Menders</strong> — Medical care, psychological support, recovery assistance. Leader: Healer Mistpetal. Healers and caretakers stretched thin by the faction's many wounded. They treat both body and mind.</p><p><strong>On the docket:</strong> Herbal & elemental salves, level 2 (a T-pun name). <q>Smells like a greenhouse won a fight.</q></p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Equipment</strong> — Medical supplies, Healing herbs, Psychological care materials (the weapon items)</li><li><strong>Specialisations</strong> — Trauma care, Psychological support, Recovery (the cohort feat)</li><li><strong>Commoner</strong> — classDefinitions.commoner: Survivor's Instinct (L1); Strength in Numbers (L2)</li><li><strong>Status</strong> — overwhelmed: Too many patients, not enough healers</li></ul>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
