          "value": "<p><em>Menders specialisations: Trauma care, Psychological support, Recovery. Equipment: Medical supplies, Healing herbs, Psychological care materials.</em></p><p><strong>Trauma care.</strong> As an action, Elemen T uses a healer's kit on a creature within 5 feet: it is stabilised and regains 1d6 + Elemen T's Wisdom modifier hit points. Uses per long rest: half Elemen T's level, rounded up. <strong>Psychological support.</strong> A creature that spends a short rest talking with Elemen T can end the frightened condition. <strong>Recovery.</strong> A creature under Elemen T's care regains an extra Hit Die's worth of hit points on a long rest.</p>",
